[91.618302, "o", "# Vulnerability Report\r\n\r\nA CVE-driven entry vector was identified:\r\n\r\n- CVE-2021-44228 — `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp` (webshell (jndi, ldap, webshell))\r\n\r\nConfidence: high. Evidence cited inline.\r\n"]
